# tests/warm-crash, as an ENTRY (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): evaluating this
# directory yields the test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST of the crash backstop for a WARM runner's later job
# (design/firecracker-runners.md, phase 0b). `crashy` is the built image of
# dev/warm-crash-test, whose runner dies on claiming its second job; `job` is
# the script each of the two jobs runs.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --crashy:@=DEEP-DEPS/warm-crash-test --job:@=job.sh
